error[E0515]: 'level' is write-only outside its class
 --> $DIR/write-only-update.nra:7:1
  |
4 |         | set: level = value;
  |         --------------------- 'level' declares only a setter
...
7 | sink.level += 2;
  | ^^^^^^^^^^ this updates 'level', which reads it first
  |
  = note: 'level' has no 'get' accessor, so code outside 'Sink' can assign it but not update it
  = help: assign a new value with '=', or add a getter such as '| get: level;'

For more information about this error, try `neura explain E0515`.
